### get organization that user is admin
GET https://localhost:8443/b2b/orgs/gustavo.figueiredo.5@wriconsultant.org
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### get all connections
GET https://localhost:8443/b2b/connection?
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### accpect connection
PUT https://localhost:8443/b2b/connection/accept/75
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### accpect connection
PUT https://localhost:8443/b2b/connection/reject/75
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### accpect connection
PUT https://localhost:8443/b2b/connection/cancel/75
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}